  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2018-2024 Ford Expedition 7-Seater(Not for Max/Limited Models)\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are compatible with 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 Ford Expedition （Not Fit for MAX/Limited Model) 7-Seater 2nd Row Bucket Seat ; 3D laser scanning technology provides full protection for the first, second, and third rows, trunk, and seat backs\nEco-Safe Certification: Our floor mats are recyclable and durable, approved by GRS, SGS, and IATF; Eco-safe material withstands the rigor of daily abuse, offering great performance in both arctic cold and tropical heat\nAll-Season Protection & Non-Slip: With unique channels and raised edges, our floor liner and cargo liner effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; The hooks provide anti-slip stability even in wet conditions\nEasy To Clean: These floor mats feature a textured, skid-resistant surface that is easy to clean; Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; Simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats and backrest mat, trunk mat are crafted with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard for your vehicle; The safe material is suitable for people of all ages",
